#: src/webhook/handlers/tutorial.ts:309
msgid ""
"When I provide hoax-busting replies to you, I would like to ask you for any "
"feedback on the crowd-sourced reply.\n"
"In order to achieve that, I need to ask for your permission to \"Send "
"messages to chats\".\n"
"The permission will be used to send only this one message of yours back to "
"this particular chatroom.\n"
"You can still use Cofacts without granting me this permission. When we ask "
"for feedback from you, the permission dialog will pop-up again."
msgstr ""
"Saat aku kirim balasan bantahan hoaks ke kamu, aku perlu konfirmasi lewat chat supaya nggak salah paham. Jadi tolong pilih izin \"Kirim Pesan ke Obrolan\" ya.\\n"
"Izin \"Kirim Pesan ke Obrolan\" ini hanya dipakai untuk mengirim balasan kembali ke ruang obrolan kita ini, bukan ke ruang obrolan lain.\\n"
"\\n"
"Kalau belum mau kasih izin, fitur lain tetap bisa dipakai kok! Kalau nanti kami butuh bantuanmu, jendela permintaan izin akan muncul lagi."

